The method explains anomaly detection decisions by assigning attribution scores to image regions. Instead of relying on fixed geometric partitions, ShapBPT uses a **data-aware image hierarchy** based on Binary Partition Trees. This allows the explanation to follow meaningful visual structures in the image.

